♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Show The Evidence
Use texts, sounds through a wall, lipstick, smell, disheveled clothes, changed behavior, direct witnessing, taunting, rival confidence, partner evasions, or explicit comparison. If sex is shown, make the betrayal visible through position, dialogue, eye contact, ignored messages, or the partner's active choice.

